title    Ringmaster Rock
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Theme Park option "ringmaster": a circus-march punk polka in C major, xylophone and synth brass in unison with chromatic leading notes, over off-beat snare, power chords and an oom-pah FM bass. The trio moves to F; the last eight bars lift a semitone, to D-flat.
tempo    168
beats    4
steps    2
reverb   0.2

voice lead   synbrass   vol=0.7  bright=1.2
voice xylo   xylophone  vol=0.58 oct=1 pan=0.2
voice brass  brass      vol=0.26 pan=-0.3 center=E4 gate=0.6
voice gtr    distguitar vol=0.3  pan=0.35 gate=0.45
voice bass   fmbass     vol=0.52 gate=0.6
voice hit    orchhit    vol=0.42
voice kick   kick       vol=0.62
voice snare  snare      vol=0.5  pan=0.05
voice bell   cowbell    vol=0.18 pan=-0.4
voice crash  crash      vol=0.3  pan=-0.2

