lead  | G4 G#4 A4 A#4 B4 C5 C#5 D5 | G5! . G5! . G5!--- |
xylo  | G4 G#4 A4 A#4 B4 C5 C#5 D5 | G5! . G5! . G5!--- |
hit   | _ | [G7]! . [G7]! . [G7]!--- |
snare | xxxx xxxx | X.X. XXXX |

